[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_20]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_20_desc]
“Muffinology” - Presented by Duchess of Cloudsdale, Derpy Hooves\nLecture Fourty Six (actually Fourty Four, but Derpy miscounted), Sharing of Muffins

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_20_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about muffins, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_20_TRUE_TOOLTIP]
Unlock decison in §YMuffins!§!: §YGenerous Aid§!.

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_20_FALSE_TOOLTIP]
Make the decision §YGenerous Aid§! disappear.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_20]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_20_desc]
《马芬学讲座》——主讲者，云中城公爵，呆蹄\n第四十六节（其实是四十四，但是呆蹄数错了），论马芬的分享

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_20_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄在思考关于马芬的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_20_TRUE_TOOLTIP]
解锁§Y马芬！§!中的决议：§Y慷慨的援助§!。

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_20_FALSE_TOOLTIP]
让§Y慷慨的援助§!决议消失。

